"On Emban's Here-to-There night, a village master's wand held by the bors was destroyed."
"Olget-ovekondo broke it with a through-walls striking spell to keep his mother's second wand."
"Kon Roberts, invited within five minutes, restored the wand physically with his repair spell."
"Olget's siblings scrubbed his spell traces, making further searches prohibitively difficult."
"Stuart, as votary, took the case to executioner Vill-ma rather than tell the bors."
"Olget knelt in Vill-ma's courtyard; Stuart and Alden refused to unsay, ending his life as lived."
